---
---
<section class="amenities" id="comodidades">
  <div class="amenities__bg" data-parallax="0.06">
    <img src="/images/chale-9.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy">
  </div>
  <div class="amenities__head">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal"><span>03</span> Comodidades</p>
      <h2 class="section-title section-title--light">
        <span class="line"><span class="line-inner">Conforto, no seu</span></span>
        <span class="line"><span class="line-inner">próprio <em>ritmo</em>.</span></span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <p class="amenities__lead reveal">Tudo o que um casal precisa para se desconectar — e nada que roube a cena do essencial.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="amenities__grid">
    <article class="amenity" data-cursor="link" data-tilt>
      <span class="amenity__num">01</span>
      <div class="amenity__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 30c0-6 6-8 10-12 1.5-1.5 2-4 4-6 2.5-2.5 6-4 8-1.5 2 2.5.5 5.5-1 7.5-1.5 2-3.5 2.5-3.5 4.5 0 2 3 2 6 3.5 3 1.5 4.5 4.5 4.5 7.5 0 5-4.5 8-10 8S8 35 8 30Z"/><path d="M13 37c0 3 3 4 6 4"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Banheira quente</h3>
      <p>Banho relaxante sob as estrelas do sertão.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="amenity" data-cursor="link" data-tilt>
      <span class="amenity__num">02</span>
      <div class="amenity__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 14h32v6H8z"/><path d="M10 20h28l-3 20H13l-3-20z"/><path d="M18 40v-10h12v10M20 14V9h8v5"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Kitchenette</h3>
      <p>Sua cozinha completa para dias sem pressa.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="amenity" data-cursor="link" data-tilt>
      <span class="amenity__num">03</span>
      <div class="amenity__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 18a26 26 0 0 1 40 0"/><path d="M10 26a16 16 0 0 1 28 0"/><path d="M16 34a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="24" cy="40" r="2" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Wi-Fi</h3>
      <p>Conexão de qualidade — se você quiser usar.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="amenity" data-cursor="link" data-tilt>
      <span class="amenity__num">04</span>
      <div class="amenity__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="6" width="36" height="36" rx="4"/><path d="M6 20h36M6 12h36"/><circle cx="14" cy="32" r="2.5"/><circle cx="22" cy="32" r="2.5"/><path d="M28 32h6"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Ar-condicionado</h3>
      <p>Clima perfeito em qualquer estação.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="amenity" data-cursor="link" data-tilt>
      <span class="amenity__num">05</span>
      <div class="amenity__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 20c-1-6 4-10 10-10 8 0 12 5 11 11-3-1-6-2-8-5 0 4-3 7-7 8-1 0-2 1-2 2l-4 1c-2-2-2-4 0-7Z"/><path d="M22 22c-2 1-4 3-4 6l2 5c1 3 4 4 7 3"/><path d="M20 44h8M24 44v-6"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Pet friendly</h3>
      <p>Seu companheiro é bem-vindo com você.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="amenity" data-cursor="link" data-tilt>
      <span class="amenity__num">06</span>
      <div class="amenity__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 40h28M14 40V18l10-8 10 8v22M19 40V28h10v12"/><path d="M23 14h2"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Estacionamento</h3>
      <p>Estacione sem pressa, com espaço garantido.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="amenity" data-cursor="link" data-tilt>
      <span class="amenity__num">07</span>
      <div class="amenity__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="8" y="8" width="32" height="32" rx="4"/><path d="M8 24h32M24 8v32"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Vista para o jardim</h3>
      <p>A natureza inteira emoldurada na janela.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="amenity" data-cursor="link" data-tilt>
      <span class="amenity__num">08</span>
      <div class="amenity__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="14" width="38" height="24" rx="3"/><path d="M5 20h38M10 30h4"/></svg></div>
      <h3>TV LCD</h3>
      <p>Uma maratona a dois, se a noite pedir.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
